<title>JAPAN: Bank of Ikeda to brief media on earnings revision.</title>
<headline>Bank of Ikeda to brief media on earnings revision.</headline>
<dateline>OSAKA, Japan 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Ikeda Ltd said on Tuesday it would hold a news conference at 3 p.m. (0600 GMT) on an earnings revision and real estate sale.</p>
<p>The regional bank said last November that it expected revenues of 74.0 billion yen in the year ending on March 31, down from 88.65 billion yen in the 1995/96 business year.</p>
